    "test_synchronization": "Observe the real owner/view/grant-scoped API for at most5s, then exercise the explicit UI query; keep all original UI assertion timeouts, frame, pixel and reclaim assertions",
    "unchanged": "No native protocol, database schema, model calls, foreground input, runtime timeout, permission check or production polling changed",
